      "evidence_refs": [
        {
          "source_id": "FISRC-c8567b52c3776e28",
          "quote": "&quot;Doctor-led longevity and preventive healthcare startup Vytalyou has raised Rs 9 crore in a pre-Series A round from Chetan Jain of Pharma Dose and Ratan Jain of Venus Industries at a valuation of around Rs 33 crore. The proceeds will be used to expand its network of Incremental Lifestyle Clinics in Mumbai, Vytalyou said in a press release. Founded in 2025 by Chirantan Bose and Preetesh Bhandari, Vytalyou provides preventive healthcare and longevity-focused services, combining diagnostics with personalised health interventions and medically supervised care. The Mumbai-based startup offers services across pathology, radiology, cardio-respiratory assessments, body composition evaluation, genetic and cancer screening, gut microbiome evaluation, personalised IV therapies and regenerative interventions. It also offers non-invasive pain management technologies for chronic musculoskeletal conditions. Vytalyou uses an AI-based algorithm for its Predictive Longevity Evaluation, which assesses an individual&amp;quot;s health profile, biological ageing and potential health risks.",
          "source_content_hash": "5774882366d2c4f5746c8ae784bb63e142a0c621e5468f9ad8dda965d9020199",
          "quote_hash": "530d3d010d1be4edbbff0efcae117fb353db2fab5d59abc8abb2dcbc23718318"
